    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Cocktails\nMAI TAI\nA fabulous South Seas potion that blends the sunny glow of\nrum with the exotic flavors of tropical fruit.\nSip! And dream of sunset on the reef.\nMENEHUNEJUICE\nThis lighthearted libation creates the right mood for\nMenehune watching. A rainbow of Polynesian flavors\ncombines with fine light rum to set the stage.\nUNITED'S VERY DRY BEEFEATER MARTINI\nUNITED'S VERY DRY SMIRNOFF VODKA MARTINI\nMANHATTAN\nSCREWDRIVER\nBLOODY MARY\nWHISKEY SOUR\n1.50\nSpirits\nOLD FORESTER BOURBON\nCUTTY SARK SCOTCH\nDEWAR'S WHITE LABEL SCOTCH\nCANADIAN CLUB\nJACK DANIELS TENNESSEE WHISKEY\nBEEFEATER GIN\nSMIRNOFF VODKA\nBACARDI RUM\nCHRISTIAN BROTHERS BRANDY\n1.50\nWines and Beer\nBERINGER PINOT NOIR - VINTAGE\nBERINGER CHENIN BLANC\nDRY SACK SHERRY\n1.50\nDOMESTIC BEER\n1.00\nLiqueurs\nBENEDICTINE AND BRANDY\nCOGNAC\nGRAND MARNIER\nAMARETTO di SARONNO\nCREME DE MENTHE\nRUSTY NAIL\nKAHLUA\n1.50\n*\nSOFT BEVERAGES\nMinors Cannot Be Served Liquor.\nSalad\nGARDEN ISLE SALAD\nA monkeypod bowl contains fresh garden vegetables and fresh pineapple\nwith a touch of coconut. Garnished and served with Gourmet Dressing.\nYour Choice of\nBEEF ESTERHAZY\nCreated for a Prince of the Hungarian House of Esterhazy.\nWe combine tender\nslices of beef, cooked in a sauce rich with red wine and tomatoes with a\ntouch of Hungarian paprika, and top it all with a fine julienne of vegetables\nsauteed in butter. A contribution to our menu by Chef Wolfgang Mayer\nof the Kona Surf Hotel on our Big Island of Hawaii.\nTHE CHEF'S SPECIALTY\nBARBECUED CHICKEN MAUNA KEA\nTender breast of chicken prepared with Chinese Oyster Sauce, onions,\nshoyu and other special ingredients. Served with rice pilaf and a medley\nof garden vegetables.\nTORTELLINI FLORENTINE\nThis is not an everyday dish. We arrange specially filled pasta pillows,\nadd a tempting cheese sauce, ham and spinach, and top it off with\na sprinkle of Parmesan Cheese.\nDINNER ROLL and BUTTER\nDessert\nFRESH HAWAIIAN COCONUT CAKE\nCOFFEE\nBeverages\nTEA\nMILK\nSanka\nPlease accept our apology if, due to previous passenger\nselections, your choice is not available.\nITO\n(H)L D12-3"
    ],
